  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "气色比之前好多了  (Looking Much Better in Hospital)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the quiet hospital room, Chun Yuqiao wakes up to find Bu Xiaogu standing beside his bed, and their conversation turns warm as he thanks her for that exhausting night. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你刚才是不是梦见我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是睡得太多了，所以就老梦见工作的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "睡得多好，你虽然比之前瘦了点，但是气色比之前好多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是吗？那天晚上谢谢你帮我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没帮上什么忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我其实挺想跟你们一块来医院的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是凯文哥说了，你们要折腾到很晚，就催我回家了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对，那天是折腾到特别晚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你一个人在外边，也不在爸爸妈妈身边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要多照顾好自己，注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实那天晚上我也很晚才睡。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你刚才是不是梦见我了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Were you dreaming about me just now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是睡得太多了，所以就老梦见工作的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have simply slept too much, so I keep dreaming about work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "睡得多好，你虽然比之前瘦了点，但是气色比之前好多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sleeping is great—though you look a little thinner, your colour is much healthier than before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "是吗？那天晚上谢谢你帮我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is that so? Thank you for helping me that night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没帮上什么忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I barely helped at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我其实挺想跟你们一块来医院的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really wanted to come to the hospital together with everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是凯文哥说了，你们要折腾到很晚，就催我回家了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet Brother Kaiwen said it would drag on late into the night and urged me to go home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对，那天是折腾到特别晚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, things did drag on very late that night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你一个人在外边，也不在爸爸妈妈身边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are out here on your own, away from your mum and dad.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要多照顾好自己，注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take good care of yourself and stay safe.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实那天晚上我也很晚才睡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Truthfully, I stayed up very late that night too before falling asleep.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
